  "kv22.6:1.1": "Sabbaṃ supinagatassa cittaṃ abyākatan ti? ",
  "kv22.6:1.2": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv22.6:1.3": "Supinantena pāṇaṃ haneyyāti? ",
  "kv22.6:1.4": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv22.6:1.5": "Hañci supinantena pāṇaṃ haneyya, no vata re vattabbe ",
  "kv22.6:1.6": "\"Sabbaṃ supinagatassa cittaṃ abyākatan ti.\" ",
  "kv22.6:2.1": "Supinantena ādinnaṃ ādiyeyya --pe-- ",
  "kv22.6:2.2": "musā bhaṇeyya -- pe -- ",
  "kv22.6:2.3": "pisunaṃ bhaṇeyya -- ",
  "kv22.6:2.4": "pharusaṃ bhaṇeyya -- ",
  "kv22.6:2.5": "samphappalāpeyya -- ",
  "kv22.6:2.6": "sandhiṃ chindeyya -- ",
